        How to Save a Screenshot Directly as a File (Without Opening MS Paint)
    </h1>

    <AuthorByline publishDate="2026-06-10" updatedDate="2026-08-22" changeNote="Added a real file-size comparison and a screenshot of the URL download tool." />

